      "delta": "Here"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": " is how you convert the legacy `*ngFor` with `trackBy` to the"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": " modern `@for` block (introduced in Angular 17). \n\n### The Conversion\n\n**Legacy Approach (Angular"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": " 16 and older):**\n```html\n<ul>\n  <li *ngFor=\"let item of items"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": "; trackBy: trackByItemId\">{{ item.name }}</li>\n</ul>\n```\n```typescript\ntrackByItemId(index: number"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": ", item: Item): number {\n  return item.id;\n}\n```\n\n**Modern Approach (Angular 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": "7+):**\n```html\n<ul>\n  @for (item of items(); track item.id) {\n    "
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": "<li>{{ item.name }}</li>\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Key Differences\n* **`track"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": "` replaces `trackBy`**: You no longer need to write a separate component method to return an identifier. You just pass an expression"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": " directly to `track`.\n* **Inline expression**: `track item.id` tells Angular to track items by their "
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": "`id` property. If your items are primitives, you can use `track $item` or `track $index`.\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant",
      "delta": "* **No `ngForOf`**: `@for` uses standard JavaScript-like iteration syntax (`item of items`)."
    },
    {
      "type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_END",
      "messageId": "e802f66e-a5d0-419c-b36c-4630ee2e9bb3:assistant"
    },
